  ('Molecule', 5, 'noun', '/ˈmɒl.ɪ.kjuːl/', 'A group of atoms bonded together, representing the smallest fundamental unit of a chemical compound.', 'Molekula', 'Молекула', 'A single water molecule consists of two hydrogen atoms bonded to one oxygen atom.', 'Bitta suv molekulasi bitta kislorod atomiga birikkan ikkita vodorod atomidan iborat.', '["water molecule","organic molecule","complex molecule"]'::jsonb, '["particle","atomic structure","compound unit"]'::jsonb, 91),
