  ('Deter', 6, 'verb', '/dɪˈtɜːr/', 'To discourage someone from doing something by instilling doubt or fear of consequences.', 'Yo''ldan qaytarmoq, to''xtatib qolmoq', 'Удерживать, отпугивать', 'Installing surveillance cameras acts as a powerful measure to deter potential burglars.', 'Kuzatuv kameralarini o''rnatish ehtimoliy o''g''rilarni yo''ldan qaytaruvchi kuchli vosita bo''lib xizmat qiladi.', '["deter crime","deter someone from","act as a deterrent"]'::jsonb, '["discourage","dissuade","prevent","inhibit"]'::jsonb, 104),
  ('Devise', 6, 'verb', '/dɪˈvaɪz/', 'To plan or invent a complex procedure, system, or mechanism by careful thought.', 'Ishlab chiqmoq, o''ylab topmoq', 'Разрабатывать, изобретать', 'Researchers devised an innovative mathematical formula to predict climate anomalies.', 'Tadqiqotchilar iqlim anomaliyalarini bashorat qilish uchun innovatsion matematik formulani ishlab chiqdilar.', '["devise a plan","devise a strategy","devise a method"]'::jsonb, '["formulate","concoct","design","invent"]'::jsonb, 105),
