  ('Impair', 6, 'verb', '/ɪmˈpeər/', 'To weaken or damage the strength, quality, or functionality of something.', 'Zaiflashtirmoq, shikastlamoq', 'Ухудшать, ослаблять, повреждать', 'Chronic sleep deprivation significantly impairs cognitive performance and memory retention.', 'Surunkali uyqusizlik aqliy faoliyat va xotirani sezilarli darajada zaiflashtiradi.', '["impair vision","impair judgment","impair hearing"]'::jsonb, '["weaken","damage","diminish","undermine"]'::jsonb, 108),
  ('Implement', 6, 'verb', '/ˈɪm.plɪ.ment/', 'To put a decision, plan, or agreement into practical effect.', 'Amalga oshirmoq, joriy etmoq', 'Внедрять, осуществлять, реализовывать', 'The government decided to implement strict new environmental policies to reduce smog.', 'Hukumat tutunni kamaytirish uchun qat''iy yangi ekologik siyosatni amalga oshirishga qaror qildi.', '["implement changes","implement a policy","implement a strategy"]'::jsonb, '["execute","enact","carry out","apply"]'::jsonb, 109),
