  ('Limb', 6, 'noun', '/lɪm/', 'An arm or leg of a person or four-legged animal, or a large branch of a tree.', 'Qo''l yoki oyoq; daraxt shoxi', 'Конечность (рука или нога); ветвь', 'After sitting in an awkward position for two hours, his limbs felt completely numb.', 'Ikki soat noqulay holatda o''tirgach, uning oyoq-qo''llari butunlay uvushib qoldi.', '["upper limbs","lower limbs","tree limb"]'::jsonb, '["arm","leg","extremity","branch"]'::jsonb, 112),
  ('Migraine', 6, 'noun', '/ˈmiː.ɡreɪn/', 'A recurrent throbbing headache that typically affects one side of the head and is often accompanied by nausea and sensitivity to light.', 'Migren, kuchli bosh og''rig''i', 'Мигрень', 'Bright computer screens and loud noise can trigger a debilitating migraine attack.', 'Yorqin kompyuter ekranlari va baland shovqin kuchli migren xurujini qo''zg''atishi mumkin.', '["suffer from migraine","migraine attack","chronic migraine"]'::jsonb, '["severe headache","hemicrania","cephalalgia"]'::jsonb, 113),
  ('Optimism', 6, 'noun', '/ˈɒp.tɪ.mɪ.zəm/', 'Hopefulness and confidence about the future or the success of something.', 'Nekbinlik, kelajakka ishonch, optimizm', 'Оптимизм', 'Despite the daunting challenges, the young entrepreneur approached the future with boundless optimism.', 'Qo''rqinchli qiyinchiliklarga qaramay, yosh tadbirkor kelajakka cheksiz nekbinlik bilan qaradi.', '["cautious optimism","sense of optimism","unwavering optimism"]'::jsonb, '["hopefulness","confidence","positivity","cheerfulness"]'::jsonb, 114),
