  ('Tolerate', 6, 'verb', '/ˈtɒl.ər.eɪt/', 'To allow the existence, occurrence, or practice of something without interference; to endure.', 'Chidamoq, sabr qilmoq, chidab bermoq', 'Терпеть, выносить, относиться толерантно', 'The school principal declared that the institution will not tolerate any form of student bullying.', 'Maktab direktori muassasa o''quvchilar bezoriligining har qanday ko''rinishiga mutlaqo toqat qilmasligini bildirdi.', '["tolerate bad behavior","cannot tolerate","learn to tolerate"]'::jsonb, '["endure","bear","stand","put up with"]'::jsonb, 121),
