  ('Biosphere', 7, 'noun', '/ˈbaɪ.əʊ.sfɪər/', 'The regions of the surface, atmosphere, and hydrosphere of the earth occupied by living organisms.', 'Biosfera, hayot qobig''i', 'Биосфера', 'Industrial pollution threatens the delicate equilibrium of our planet''s global biosphere.', 'Sanoat ifloslanishi sayyoramizning nozik global biosferasi muvozanatiga tahdid solmoqda.', '["global biosphere","protect the biosphere","biosphere reserve"]'::jsonb, '["ecosystem","living world","ecosphere"]'::jsonb, 123),
