  ('Ecology', 7, 'noun', '/iˈkɒl.ə.dʒi/', 'The branch of biology that deals with the relations of organisms to one another and to their physical surroundings.', 'Ekologiya, atrof-muhit fani', 'Экология', 'Deforestation in tropical rainforests severely damages the delicate local ecology and causes species extinction.', 'Tropik o''rmonlarning kesilishi nozik mahalliy ekologiyaga qattiq zarar yetkazadi va turlarning yo''qolib ketishiga sabab bo''ladi.', '["study ecology","marine ecology","preserve local ecology"]'::jsonb, '["environmental science","bionomics","conservation"]'::jsonb, 130),
