  ('Notorious', 11, 'adjective', '/nəʊˈtɔː.ri.əs/', 'Famous or well known, typically for some bad quality or deed.', 'Yomon nom chiqargan, nomchiqqan', 'Печально известный, пользующийся дурной славой', 'The crossroads was notorious for frequent, severe automobile accidents in bad weather.', 'Chorrahada yomon ob-havoda tez-tez yuz beradigan og''ir avtohalokatlar tufayli yomon nom chiqargan edi.', '["notorious criminal","notorious for","notorious case"]'::jsonb, '["infamous","scandalous","ill-famed"]'::jsonb, 216),
